# Situational questions that have a deterministic answer.
[what_am_i_doing]
what am i [doing|working on] [right now]
what [am i|have i] got open

[who_is_around]
who [is|s] [around|nearby|here] [right now]
is anyone [around|nearby|here]

[whatsapp_inbox]
[any] [new|unread] [whatsapp] messages
who [has] messaged me
